WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 1: Open Ordering → Stock items. Choose Add new stock or the pencil beside an existing item.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Step 2: Use Item details for name, supplier, price, supplier SKU, category and optional photo.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Step 3: Use Pack &amp; counting for unit amount, storage group and smaller-pack conversion.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.958
Step 4: Use Ordering rules for minimum quantities, rounding and the selected location’s Target calculation: Automatic usage (current) or Projected sales.

5
00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:32.458
Step 5: Press Save changes once for the whole popup. Correct any highlighted field if its tab opens.
